D1 setup: same content, same inode, mtime restored, ctime moved -> v2 must catch ctime
D1 in-place same-content rewrite (expect REWRITE-DRIFT/11): exit=11
    REWRITE-DRIFT  compared=11/11 moved=ctime_ns
D2 setup: temp+rename, same content, mtime restored -> inode moved
D2 rename same-content rewrite (expect REWRITE-DRIFT/11): exit=11
    REWRITE-DRIFT  compared=11/11 moved=inode
D3 mtime moved +5s (expect REWRITE-DRIFT/11): exit=11
    REWRITE-DRIFT  compared=11/11 moved=mtime_ns,mtime_epoch
D4 chmod (mode class wins over ctime side-effect) (expect METADATA-DRIFT/12): exit=12
    METADATA-DRIFT  compared=11/11 moved=mode,ctime_ns
D5 path deleted (expect ABSENT/13): exit=13
    ABSENT  compared=0/11 moved=exists
